action,x,y,origin,button,key,micros,note,platform
# P36 on Windows, GtkBackend: press the one control in the app that leaves a
# trace, and prove it was that control and not the Picker above or the TextField
# below.
#
# expect: log-contains button clicked
#
# EVIDENCE FOR THAT MARKER: p36-debug-events.log holds `button clicked` as its
# third and last line, twice, from two runs of this file in different working
# directories -- the repo-root copy at 2026-09-03 05:43:15 and
# testapp/p36-debug-events.log at 2026-09-05 13:12:55, each two to three seconds
# after that run's `RENDER COMPLETE`. testapp/output/p36-debug-events.log, from a
# launch with no action file, holds `backend WinUIBackend` and `RENDER COMPLETE`
# and stops there.
#
# THIS IS THE ONLY EVIDENCE THIS FILE CAN HAVE, which the header below already
# says: nothing on screen changes, so a capture corroborates nothing. Before the
# marker, a run in which the click slipped into the TextField 14 points below
# reported `ok / ok / window` -- identical to one that worked.
#
# CHECKED FOR COLLISIONS, since the driver searches the run log as well and
# `button clicked` is a common phrase: measured 2026-09-07,
# `grep -l "button clicked"` over all 35 logs in /tmp/sweep_drive-gtk4 matches
# none of them. P31 writes `button clicked count=1`, which would satisfy this
# text -- but it is a different app and writes to its own log, and the driver
# only ever reads THIS app's.
#
# 該標記的證據：p36-debug-events.log 以 `button clicked` 作為第三行、也是最後一行，共兩次，
# 來自本檔在不同工作目錄下的兩次執行——repo 根目錄那份為 2026-09-03 05:43:15，
# testapp/p36-debug-events.log 為 2026-09-05 13:12:55，兩者都在該次 `RENDER COMPLETE` 之後
# 二至三秒。而來自一次沒有動作檔之啟動的 testapp/output/p36-debug-events.log，只有
# `backend WinUIBackend` 與 `RENDER COMPLETE` 便告終止。
#
# **這是本檔唯一可能擁有的證據**，下方標頭已經說了：畫面上什麼都不會變，因此擷圖佐證不了任何事。
# 在有這個標記之前，一次「點擊滑進下方 14 點處 TextField」的執行，回報的是 `ok / ok / window`
# ——與成功的那一次一模一樣。
#
# **查過碰撞**，因為驅動器連 run log 也一併搜尋，而 `button clicked` 是很常見的說法：2026-09-07
# 實測，對 /tmp/sweep_drive-gtk4 中全部 35 份 log 執行 `grep -l "button clicked"`，沒有任何一份
# 命中。P31 會寫出 `button clicked count=1`，那確實會滿足這段文字——但它是另一支 app、寫進自己的
# log，而驅動器只會讀取**本** app 的那一份。
#
# WHY THIS CONTROL. P36 has three interactive things stacked in a column --
# a Picker at y 210..241, "String label button" at y 286..317, and a TextField
# at y 331..363 -- and only the button writes to the log. Read P36.swift: the
# Button's action calls P36Diagnostics.write("button clicked"); the Picker's
# $pickerSelection binding and the TextField's $text binding call nothing. The
# gap between the button and the TextField is FOURTEEN points, so this is
# exactly the case the centre rule exists for: a hit near the bottom edge that
# worked cannot be told apart from one that slipped into the text entry. The log
# line is what settles it -- the TextField cannot produce "button clicked", and
# neither can the Picker.
#
# THIS FILE IS LOG-ONLY EVIDENCE. Nothing on screen changes when the button is
# pressed: the action's whole body is the write call, no state is touched, and
# the before and after captures are identical. The capture corroborates nothing
# here; it can only show that the window was still up and had not, say, opened
# the Picker's dropdown over the frame. Compare P30 in this directory, where the
# rectangle visibly widens. Same shape as P32, and for the same reason -- the
# distinct message is doing all the work.
#
# ONE claim. Neither the button nor a Picker selection would move the layout, so
# a second row would be safe here in a way it is not in P33 -- but the Picker
# opens a popup that overlays the frame and covers the TextField, and any file
# that grew to include it would need re-measuring after every step. Keep them
# for their own files.
#
# Coordinates read off a wincap capture of the frame at 848x649 (P36 asks for
# 820x620 and GTK gives it more), GtkBackend, 2026-09-03, 100% display scale,
# origin=frame like every other file here. The button spans x 34..171,
# y 286..317; (102, 301) is its centre.
#
# BUILD IT WITH THE FLAG or this file does nothing at all:
#   SCUI_DEBUG=1 zsh testapp/compile.zsh -gtk4 P36
# GtkBackend guards its ActionFileReplay call with #if SCUI_DEBUG. Without it
# the replay is compiled out and the failure is silent -- run.zsh accepts the
# path, the app launches and renders, and not one line is printed. P36's own
# --debug flag is a SEPARATE gate controlling whether the app writes its log at
# all; both are needed, and without --debug the log file is never created and
# nothing says why. Here that matters more than usual, because the log is the
# only evidence there is.
#
# READ THE RESULT FROM p36-debug-events.log IN THE CURRENT DIRECTORY, not
# testapp/output/ -- P36 builds its path from currentDirectoryPath and run.zsh
# launches by absolute path without cd'ing. MEASURED, the third and last line:
#     button clicked
# The two before it -- "backend GtkBackend" and "RENDER COMPLETE" -- come from
# .onAppear and are printed whether or not anything is clicked. A log holding
# only those two means the click did not reach the button, and the picture will
# not tell you so.
#
# P36 於 Windows、GtkBackend：按下這支 app 中唯一會留下痕跡的控制項，並證明命中的是它，而非其上
# 的 Picker 或其下的 TextField。
#
# **為何選它。** P36 有三個可互動的東西縱向排列——Picker 位於 y 210..241、「String label
# button」位於 y 286..317、TextField 位於 y 331..363——而只有按鈕會寫 log。見 P36.swift：
# Button 的 action 呼叫 P36Diagnostics.write("button clicked")；Picker 的 $pickerSelection
# binding 與 TextField 的 $text binding 什麼也不呼叫。按鈕與 TextField 之間只差 **14 點**，
# 因此這正是「取中心」這條規則存在的情境：一次靠近下緣而成功的命中，無法與「滑進文字輸入框」區分
# 開來。定案的是那一行 log——TextField 產不出「button clicked」，Picker 也不行。
#
# **本檔的證據僅來自 log。** 按下按鈕時畫面上沒有任何變化：該 action 的全部內容就是那個 write
# 呼叫，沒有動到任何 state，前後兩張擷圖完全相同。擷圖在此佐證不了任何事；它至多能顯示視窗仍在，
# 而且沒有（例如）把 Picker 的下拉選單蓋在畫面上。對照本目錄的 P30，那裡的矩形會明顯變寬。與 P32
# 同一種形狀，理由也相同——全部的工作都由那則獨特訊息承擔。
#
# **只做一個主張。** 按鈕與 Picker 選取都不會移動版面，因此此處多加一列，在 P33 不安全的意義上是
# 安全的——但 Picker 會開出一個覆蓋畫面並遮住 TextField 的 popup，任何擴充納入它的檔案，每一步
# 之後都得重新量測。那些留給它們自己的檔案。
#
# 座標取自 2026-09-03 於 100% 顯示縮放下、848x649 的 wincap frame 擷圖（P36 要求 820x620，GTK
# 給了更大的），origin=frame。按鈕橫跨 x 34..171、y 286..317，(102, 301) 為其中心。
#
# **必須帶旗標建置**，否則本檔完全不會有任何作用：
#   SCUI_DEBUG=1 zsh testapp/compile.zsh -gtk4 P36
# GtkBackend 以 #if SCUI_DEBUG 包住它呼叫 ActionFileReplay 之處。少了它，重放會被編譯掉，而
# 失敗是靜默的——run.zsh 接受路徑、app 正常啟動並繪製，卻一行都不印。P36 自身的 --debug 是
# **另一道**開關，控制 app 是否寫出 log；兩者缺一不可，而少了 --debug 時 log 檔根本不會被建立，
# 且沒有任何訊息說明原因。此事在這裡比平常更要緊，因為 log 是**唯一**的證據。
#
# **結果請讀目前工作目錄下的 p36-debug-events.log**，而非 testapp/output/——P36 由
# currentDirectoryPath 組出路徑，而 run.zsh 以絕對路徑啟動且不做 cd。**實測**的第三行也是最後
# 一行：
#     button clicked
# 在它之前的兩行——「backend GtkBackend」與「RENDER COMPLETE」——來自 .onAppear，無論有沒有點擊
# 都會印出。若 log 只有那兩行，就表示點擊沒有到達按鈕，而畫面不會告訴你這件事。
sleep,,,,,,900000,let the window settle and take focus,windows
click,102,301,frame,left,,,"centre of ""String label button"" (x 34..171 y 286..317) -- the TextField top edge is only 14 points below at y 331 and it logs nothing",windows
sleep,,,,,,1500000,hold for the capture and let the log catch up,windows
